From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KB2UKA <kb2uka80@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:03:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 40/41] arm64: dts: apple: t8132: Add cluster cpufreq, capped
 at the handoff clocks

Add the E and P cluster performance controllers and their OPP tables.
Both tables stop at the state iBoot leaves each cluster in (E 900 MHz,
P 1800 MHz), so no core runs faster or hotter than at handoff; higher
states need a CPU thermal policy first.

capacity-dmips-mhz is measured: at 900 and 1800 MHz an E core did
0.324x the work of a P core (python, zlib, xz, sort; geometric mean),
so E = 0.324 * 1800 / 900 * 1024 = 663.

Based on work from Omarchy-M4-Native
(https://github.com/Kb2uka/Omarchy-M4-Native), released under GPL-2.0.

Signed-off-by: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
---
